msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Structure matrix"
msgstr "Structuurmatrix"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid ""
"An item by factor structure matrix. This is just the loadings (pattern) "
"matrix times the factor intercorrelation matrix."
msgstr ""
"Een item-bij-factor structuurmatrix. Dit is gewoon de ladingen (patroon) "
"matrix maal de factor-intercorrelatiematrix."

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Component correlations"
msgstr "Component correlaties"

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Factor correlations"
msgstr "Factorcorrelaties"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid ""
"When selecting this option, a table with the correlations between the "
"components/factors will be displayed."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer deze optie wordt geselecteerd, wordt een tabel met de correlaties "
"tussen de componenten/factoren weergegeven."

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Additional fit indices"
msgstr "Extra pas indices"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid ""
"This option displays the Root Mean Squared Error of Approximation (RMSEA) "
"with 90% confidence interval, the Tucker Lewis Index (TLI), and the Bayesian "
"Information Criterion (BIC) to test the fit of the model."
msgstr ""
"Deze optie toont de Root Mean Squared Error of Approximation (RMSEA) met 90% "
"betrouwbaarheidsinterval, de Tucker Lewis Index (TLI) en het Bayesiaans "
"Informatiecriterium (BIC) om de fit van het model te toetsen."

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Residual matrix"
msgstr "Residuele matrix"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Displays a table containing the residual variances and correlations."
msgstr "Toont een tabel met de residuvarianties en -correlaties."

